a via email and went straight to the print shop. With the PhotoStick’s USB end it was easy to get physical copies of THE image. I just plugged the device into the shop’s printer and within seconds, I held her picture in my hands.<br><br>Now, I bet you’re curious about the device that saved my memories of my Mom…</p><img alt="TPSO X_Kristina Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png__PID:09e68a12-2f3f-46de-a703-989883211bcb" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_X_Kristina_Unboxing_9x16-32.86.png?v=1774399418&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:0.5625" width="1080" height="1920" sizes="75vw" data-action="url" data-href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-ezrfit jWdAoc pf